sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Client
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant MutWebhook as Mutating Webhook<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    participant ValWebhook as Validating Webhook<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    participant ISController as InferenceService<br/>Controller
    participant LLMController as LLMInferenceService<br/>Controller
    participant KserveModule as Kserve Module<br/>Controller
    participant Agent as KServe Agent<br/>Sidecar
    participant Router as InferenceGraph<br/>Router
    participant Storage as Object Storage<br/>S3/GCS/Azure
    participant CertMgr as cert-manager

    Note over User, K8sAPI: InferenceService Creation Flow
    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply InferenceService CR
    K8sAPI->>MutWebhook: POST /mutate-inferenceservices<br/>HTTPS/TLS, Kubernetes admission
    MutWebhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated resource (defaults applied)
    K8sAPI->>ValWebhook: POST /validate-inferenceservices<br/>HTTPS/TLS, Kubernetes admission
    ValWebhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission response
    K8sAPI-->>User: Resource created

    Note over ISController, K8sAPI: Controller Reconciliation
    K8sAPI->>ISController: Watch event (InferenceService)
    ISController->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    ISController->>K8sAPI: Create Service<br/>ServiceAccount token auth
    ISController->>K8sAPI: Create Knative Service / KEDA ScaledObject
    ISController->>K8sAPI: Create VirtualService / HTTPRoute

    Note over Agent, Storage: Model Loading (Sidecar)
    Agent->>Storage: Download model artifacts<br/>HTTPS/443, Provider IAM auth
    Storage-->>Agent: Model data
    Agent->>Agent: Reverse proxy to user model container

    Note over Router, K8sAPI: InferenceGraph Request Flow
    User->>Router: POST /v1/models/model:predict<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    Router->>K8sAPI: TokenReview (Bearer token validation)<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    K8sAPI-->>Router: TokenReview response
    Router->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    K8sAPI-->>Router: Authorization result
    Router->>Router: Route via splitter/switch/ensemble/sequence
    Router-->>User: Prediction response

    Note over LLMController, CertMgr: LLMInferenceService Flow
    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply LLMInferenceService CR
    K8sAPI->>MutWebhook: POST /mutate-...-llminferenceservice<br/>HTTPS/TLS
    MutWebhook-->>K8sAPI: Mutated resource
    K8sAPI->>LLMController: Watch event
    LLMController->>K8sAPI: Create LeaderWorkerSet / Deployment
    LLMController->>K8sAPI: Create Gateway / HTTPRoute
    LLMController->>K8sAPI: Create InferencePool
    LLMController->>CertMgr: Request TLS certificates

    Note over KserveModule, K8sAPI: Platform Integration Flow
    K8sAPI->>KserveModule: Watch Kserve platform CR
    KserveModule->>K8sAPI: Deploy child resources<br/>(Deployments, DaemonSets, RBAC, Webhooks)
    KserveModule->>K8sAPI: Manage NetworkPolicies
    KserveModule->>K8sAPI: Manage SecurityContextConstraints
    KserveModule->>CertMgr: Manage Certificates / Issuers
